#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Force feedback"
msgstr "Force feedback"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Wheel force on driving games: centring and cornering\n"
"forces decoded from the game's own drive-board commands,\n"
"plus an impact jolt when you hit something."
msgstr ""
"Sila volantu v pretekárskych hrách: centrovacie a zákrutové\n"
"sily dekódované z príkazov pre drive board hry,\n"
"plus náraz, keď do niečoho narazíte."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Resistance"
msgstr "Odpor"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A gain on every force of the drive board. At 100 %, the\n"
"board's full power (63) gives the wheel's full force, every\n"
"force in proportion. 200 % doubles every force: those above\n"
"half the board's power (32, Sega Rally's strongest torque)\n"
"then saturate."
msgstr ""
"Zosilnenie všetkých síl riadiacej dosky. Pri 100 % dáva plný\n"
"výkon dosky (63) plnú silu volantu, každá sila v pomere. 200 %\n"
"zdvojnásobí každú silu: tie nad polovicou výkonu dosky (32,\n"
"najsilnejší moment Sega Rally) sa potom saturujú."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Panel spring"
msgstr "Pružina panela"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The centring spring of the Sega Rally Championship and\n"
"Daytona USA cabinets: very light, it brings the wheel\n"
"back and is barely felt when held against. A share of\n"
"the resistance above. The other games' cabinets drive\n"
"the wheel with no spring, and ignore this setting."
msgstr ""
"Centrovacia pružina automatov Sega Rally Championship a\n"
"Daytona USA: veľmi ľahká, vracia volant a pri držení je\n"
"sotva cítiť. Podiel odporu vyššie. Automaty ostatných hier\n"
"poháňajú volant bez pružiny a toto nastavenie ignorujú."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sega Rally Championship and Daytona USA only, all versions."
msgstr "Iba Sega Rally Championship a Daytona USA, všetky verzie."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Drive board DIP strength"
msgstr "Sila DIP riadiacej dosky"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The motor strength set on the drive board's DIP switches,\n"
"the switches ON counted in binary: 0 = all OFF.\n"
"Sega Rally: switches 1-3, 0 to 7 added to every torque.\n"
"Daytona USA: switches 1-3, 4 times that.\n"
"Indy 500, Touring Car, Over Rev, Super GT 24h:\n"
"switches 1-1 to 1-3, 0 to 7 added to every force."
msgstr ""
"Sila motora nastavená prepínačmi DIP na riadiacej doske,\n"
"zapnuté (ON) počítané binárne: 0 = všetky OFF.\n"
"Sega Rally: prepínače 1-3, 0 až 7 pripočítané ku každému\n"
"momentu. Daytona USA: prepínače 1-3, štvornásobok. Indy 500,\n"
"Touring Car, Over Rev, Super GT 24h: prepínače 1-1 až 1-3,\n"
"0 až 7 pripočítané ku každej sile."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Invert force feedback"
msgstr "Obrátiť force feedback"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For a wheel whose driver pushes the wrong way: it pulls\n"
"away from the centre instead of bringing it back, and\n"
"the game's forces go the opposite way."
msgstr ""
"Pre volant, ktorého ovládač tlačí zlým smerom: ťahá\n"
"od stredu namiesto návratu doň a sily hry\n"
"pôsobia opačne."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rumble"
msgstr "Vibrácie"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Vibrates on the game's impacts, for wheels without force\n"
"feedback. It never runs alongside force feedback."
msgstr ""
"Vibruje pri nárazoch v hre, pre volanty bez force\n"
"feedback. Nikdy nebeží súčasne s force feedback."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rumble strength"
msgstr "Sila vibrácií"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Engine vibration"
msgstr "Vibrácie motora"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An added vibration that grows with the throttle. It is not\n"
"from the game. Turn it off to feel only the game's force feedback."
msgstr ""
"Pridané vibrácie, ktoré rastú s plynom. Nepochádzajú\n"
"z hry. Vypnite, ak chcete cítiť len force feedback hry."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%u deg"
msgstr "%u st."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Steering range"
msgstr "Rozsah riadenia"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Set this to your wheel's own rotation range. The lock\n"
"angle below is mapped onto it, so matching your wheel\n"
"gives arcade-like response."
msgstr ""
"Nastavte na rozsah otáčania svojho volantu. Uhol\n"
"natočenia nižšie sa naň mapuje, takže zhoda s volantom\n"
"dáva odozvu ako na automate."

