msgid "Hold first"
msgstr "Najprv podržať"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Hold Guide, then press the other button; the game does not see them. Exit "
"goes back to the games when there are some. Service and Test always work."
msgstr ""
"Podržte Guide a potom stlačte druhé tlačidlo; hra ich nevidí. Ukončiť sa "
"vráti k hrám, ak nejaké sú. Servis a Test fungujú vždy."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Slots are named for this game's controls; dimmed ones are not used. Show "
"shortcuts lists the Guide combinations."
msgstr ""
"Polia sú pomenované podľa ovládania tejto hry; stlmené sa nepoužívajú. "
"Zobraziť skratky vypíše kombinácie s Guide."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The left stick also moves; the shoulders also act as Button 3/4. Right Lever "
"is Virtual On's. Show shortcuts lists the Guide combinations."
msgstr ""
"Ľavá páčka tiež pohybuje; ramenné tlačidlá fungujú aj ako Button 3/4. Pravá "
"páka je pre Virtual On. Zobraziť skratky vypíše kombinácie s Guide."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Stick deadzone"
msgstr "Mŕtva zóna páčky"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Stick travel about centre that reads as centre. The bar shows\n"
"the stick now: let go of it and raise this until the marker\n"
"sits inside the shaded zone. Also applies to stick aiming."
msgstr ""
"Pohyb páčky okolo stredu, ktorý sa číta ako stred. Pruh ukazuje\n"
"páčku teraz: pustite ju a zvyšujte toto, kým značka\n"
"nebude vo vytieňovanej zóne. Platí aj pre mierenie páčkou."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Stick position"
msgstr "Poloha páčky"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Stick sensitivity"
msgstr "Citlivosť páčky"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Response of a stick's travel past its deadzone. Full deflection\n"
"is always full lock; under 100% the middle of the travel does\n"
"less, over 100% it does more."
msgstr ""
"Odozva na výchylku páčky za mŕtvou zónou. Plná výchylka\n"
"je vždy plné natočenie; pod 100% robí stred rozsahu\n"
"menej, nad 100% viac."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Vibrates on the game's impacts in driving games.\n"
"Other games stay quiet."
msgstr ""
"Vibruje pri nárazoch v pretekárskych hrách.\n"
"Ostatné hry zostávajú tiché."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Steering vibration"
msgstr "Vibrácie riadenia"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An added vibration that grows as you steer. It is not\n"
"from the game. Turn it off to feel only the game's force feedback."
msgstr ""
"Pridané vibrácie, ktoré rastú so zatáčaním. Nepochádzajú\n"
"z hry. Vypnite, ak chcete cítiť len force feedback hry."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reset"
msgstr "Obnoviť"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Music volume"
msgstr "Hlasitosť hudby"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Only for games with a separate music board: Star Wars\n"
"Arcade, Sega Touring Car Championship and Top Skater.\n"
"Sound effects stay as they are."
msgstr ""
"Len pre hry so samostatnou hudobnou doskou:\n"
"Star Wars Arcade, Sega Touring Car Championship, Top Skater.\n"
"Zvukové efekty zostávajú bez zmeny."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Per-game volume"
msgstr "Hlasitosť hier"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Raise or lower a game's volume from its default level.\n"
"One slider covers every revision of a game. Off plays\n"
"every game at its default, whatever the sliders say.\n"
"\n"
"Warning: above 100% loud effects can clip (audible\n"
"distortion)."
msgstr ""
"Zvýši alebo zníži hlasitosť hry oproti predvolenej úrovni.\n"
"Jeden posuvník platí pre všetky verzie hry. Vypnuté\n"
"hrá každú hru na predvolenej úrovni bez ohľadu na posuvníky.\n"
"\n"
"Upozornenie: nad 100% môžu hlasné efekty prebudiť\n"
"(počuteľné skreslenie)."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Now playing: %s"
msgstr "Teraz hrá: %s"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reset all"
msgstr "Obnoviť všetko"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Volume"
msgstr "Hlasitosť"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Auto"
msgstr "Auto"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Vypnuté"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "On"
msgstr "Zapnuté"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Gun mode"
msgstr "Režim pištole"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The aiming crosshair, with the mouse pointer hidden.\n"
"Auto turns it on in a gun game; On hides the pointer in\n"
"every game; Off never shows a crosshair."
msgstr ""
"Zameriavač na mierenie, so skrytým kurzorom myši.\n"
"Auto ho zapne v hre so zbraňou; Zapnuté skryje kurzor\n"
"v každej hre; Vypnuté nikdy nezobrazí zameriavač."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show crosshair"
msgstr "Zobraziť zameriavač"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Draw Keisho's own crosshair. Turn off if the gun\n"
"has its own sight (e.g. a Sinden). Positional-gun\n"
"titles always draw their own regardless."
msgstr ""
"Kreslí vlastný zameriavač Keisho. Vypnite, ak má\n"
"pištoľ vlastné mieridlá (napr. Sinden). Hry s pozičnými\n"
"pištoľami kreslia svoj vždy."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Centred stick aim"
msgstr "Stredové mierenie páčkou"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A gamepad's stick points at the screen: the crosshair\n"
"sits in the centre at rest and reaches the edge at full\n"
"tilt. Off, the stick moves the crosshair like a mouse."
msgstr ""
"Páčka gamepadu mieri na obrazovku: zameriavač je\n"
"v pokoji v strede a pri plnom vychýlení dosiahne okraj.\n"
"Vypnuté, páčka posúva zameriavač ako myš."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Hide shot flash"
msgstr "Skryť záblesk výstrelu"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Hide the white flash Virtua Cop, Virtua Cop 2 and\n"
"House of the Dead show on each shot."
msgstr ""
"Skryje biely záblesk, ktorý Virtua Cop, Virtua Cop 2 a\n"
"House of the Dead ukazujú pri každom výstrele."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By default player 1 aims with the mouse (the left button fires and the right "
"reloads by shooting off screen) and player 2 with a gamepad."
msgstr "Predvolene hráč 1 mieri myšou (ľavé tlačidlo strieľa a pravé nabíja výstrelom mimo obrazovky) a hráč 2 gamepadom."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Recoil"
msgstr "Spätný ráz"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Kick the gun's rumble motor on each shot, for guns\n"
"that have one (Sinden and similar). No effect on a\n"
"gun without a motor."
msgstr ""
"Pri každom výstrele spustí vibračný motor pištole,\n"
"ak ho má (Sinden a podobné). Pri pištoli bez\n"
"motora nemá vplyv."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable recoil"
msgstr "Zapnúť spätný ráz"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Strength"
msgstr "Sila"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Devices"
msgstr "Zariadenia"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Gun %zu (player %zu): %s"
msgstr "Pištoľ %zu (hráč %zu): %s"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"No dedicated light guns detected. Player 1 aims with the mouse; the left "
"button fires and the right button reloads (shoot off screen). Plug in guns "
"in absolute mouse mode (GUN4IR, Sinden, AimTrak) before launching for "
"independent per-player aiming."
msgstr ""
"Neboli zistené žiadne svetelné pištole. Hráč 1 mieri myšou; ľavé tlačidlo "
"strieľa a pravé nabíja (výstrel mimo obrazovky). Pre nezávislé mierenie "
"každého hráča pripojte pred spustením pištole v režime absolútnej myši "
"(GUN4IR, Sinden, AimTrak)."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"No dedicated light guns detected. Player 1 aims with the mouse; the left "
"button fires and the right button reloads (shoot off screen). Plug in guns "
"tagged ID_INPUT_GUN for independent per-player aiming."
msgstr ""
"Neboli zistené žiadne svetelné pištole. Hráč 1 mieri myšou; ľavé tlačidlo "
"strieľa a pravé nabíja (výstrel mimo obrazovky). Pre nezávislé mierenie "
"každého hráča pripojte pištole označené ID_INPUT_GUN."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Gun buttons"
msgstr "Tlačidlá pištole"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Press Bind, then press the button on that player's gun."
msgstr "Stlačte Priradiť a potom tlačidlo na pištoli daného hráča."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reload/Missile"
msgstr "Nabiť/Raketa"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Hat down"
msgstr "Hat dole"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Hat left"
msgstr "Hat vľavo"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Hat right"
msgstr "Hat vpravo"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Hat up"
msgstr "Hat hore"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Player %d"
msgstr "Hráč %d"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sinden border"
msgstr "Rámik Sinden"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A bright frame around the game image that a Sinden\n"
"gun's camera tracks for aiming. Only shown in\n"
"light-gun mode."
msgstr ""
"Jasný rámik okolo obrazu hry, ktorý kamera pištole\n"
"Sinden sleduje pri mierení. Zobrazený len v režime\n"
"svetelnej pištole."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show border"
msgstr "Zobraziť rámik"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Colour"
msgstr "Farba"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Thickness"
msgstr "Hrúbka"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Link cabinets over the network"
msgstr "Prepojiť automaty cez sieť"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Race linked with other machines on the same LAN running the same\n"
"title (Sega Rally, Daytona, Super GT 24h, Indy 500, ...). Off keeps\n"
"this cabinet standalone. Takes effect on the next game launch."
msgstr ""
"Prepojené preteky s ďalšími strojmi v rovnakej sieti LAN s rovnakou\n"
"hrou (Sega Rally, Daytona, Super GT 24h, Indy 500, ...). Vypnuté\n"
"nechá automat samostatný. Prejaví sa pri ďalšom spustení hry."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The comms board is a ring: each cabinet listens on its own address and sends "
"to the next cabinet. For two machines, point each at the other. The master/"
"slave role is chosen in the game's own test menu, not here."
msgstr ""
"Komunikačná doska tvorí kruh: každý automat počúva na svojej adrese a "
"posiela ďalšiemu automatu. Pri dvoch strojoch nasmerujte každý na ten druhý. "
"Rola master/slave sa volí v testovacej ponuke hry, nie tu."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "This cabinet"
msgstr "Tento automat"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Local IP"
msgstr "Miestna IP"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Detect"
msgstr "Zistiť"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This machine's address on the cabinet LAN. Blank\n"
"listens on every interface. Detect fills it from the\n"
"primary network adapter."
msgstr ""
"Adresa tohto stroja v sieti LAN automatov. Prázdne\n"
"počúva na všetkých rozhraniach. Zistiť ju vyplní\n"
"z hlavného sieťového adaptéra."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Subnet mask"
msgstr "Maska podsiete"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Listen port"
msgstr "Port počúvania"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Cabinet number"
msgstr "Číslo automatu"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Where this cabinet sits in the ring (0-based).\n"
"For your own bookkeeping; the game negotiates the\n"
"actual link id from the ring."
msgstr ""
"Pozícia tohto automatu v kruhu (od 0).\n"
"Len pre vašu evidenciu; skutočné ID spojenia\n"
"si hra dohodne v kruhu."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Link delay (frames)"
msgstr "Oneskorenie prepojenia (snímky)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Model 3 only. How many frames late the other cabinets'\n"
"data is read. Raise it if a race over Wi-Fi stutters;\n"
"lower it on a wired LAN. Each frame shows the other\n"
"cars 1/60 s later."
msgstr ""
"Len Model 3. O koľko snímok neskôr sa čítajú dáta\n"
"ostatných automatov. Zvýšte, ak sa preteky cez\n"
"Wi-Fi zasekávajú; na káblovej sieti znížte. Každá\n"
"snímka ukazuje ostatné autá o 1/60 s neskôr."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Next cabinet in the ring"
msgstr "Ďalší automat v kruhu"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Next IP"
msgstr "Ďalšia IP"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The cabinet this one sends to. For two machines, the\n"
"other machine's IP. Blank means this cabinet does not\n"
"forward (tail of a chain)."
msgstr ""
"Automat, ktorému tento posiela. Pri dvoch strojoch IP\n"
"toho druhého. Prázdne znamená, že automat\n"
"nepreposiela (koniec reťaze)."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Next port"
msgstr "Ďalší port"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Stav"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Link configured; starts at the next game launch."
msgstr "Prepojenie nastavené; začne pri ďalšom spustení hry."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Standalone (no cabinet link)."
msgstr "Samostatný (bez prepojenia automatov)."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Waiting for the game to switch the link board on..."
msgstr "Čaká sa, kým hra zapne prepojovaciu dosku..."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Linked: cabinet %u of %u."
msgstr "Prepojené: automat %u z %u."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Establishing the ring..."
msgstr "Nadväzuje sa kruh..."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "This machine's interfaces:"
msgstr "Rozhrania tohto stroja:"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Automatic (system)"
msgstr "Automaticky (systém)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Jazyk"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Background controller input"
msgstr "Vstup ovládačov na pozadí"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Wheels and gamepads keep working while the window is\n"
"not in front. Keyboard and mouse still need the window\n"
"in front."
msgstr ""
"Volanty a gamepady fungujú, aj keď okno nie je\n"
"v popredí. Klávesnica a myš stále vyžadujú\n"
"okno v popredí."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Hold %s to step back through play.\n"
"Costs a little speed on every frame while on."
msgstr ""
"Podržaním %s sa vrátite v hre späť.\n"
"Kým je zapnuté, stojí každý snímok trochu výkonu."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rewind memory"
msgstr "Pamäť pretáčania"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Cabinet outputs"
msgstr "Výstupy automatu"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Network outputs"
msgstr "Sieťové výstupy"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Send lamps, gun recoil and drive-board output to\n"
"MAMEHooker, Hook Of The Reaper and similar tools,\n"
"using MAME's network output protocol."
msgstr ""
"Posiela svetlá, spätný ráz pištole a výstup riadiacej dosky\n"
"do MAMEHooker, Hook Of The Reaper a podobných nástrojov\n"
"pomocou sieťového výstupného protokolu MAME."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Port"
msgstr "Port"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Windows outputs"
msgstr "Výstupy pre Windows"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The same outputs over MAME's Windows message\n"
"protocol, for tools that hook MAME that way."
msgstr ""
"Rovnaké výstupy cez protokol správ Windows z MAME,\n"
"pre nástroje, ktoré sa na MAME napájajú týmto spôsobom."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Keyboard shortcuts"
msgstr "Klávesové skratky"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Back to games"
msgstr "Späť k hrám"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Settings overlay"
msgstr "Prekrytie nastavení"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Pause"
msgstr "Pozastaviť"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Fast-forward (held)"
msgstr "Pretočiť dopredu (držať)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rewind (held)"
msgstr "Pretočiť späť (držať)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "press a key..."
msgstr "stlačte kláves..."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Clear"
msgstr "Vymazať"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click a key, then press the new one. Escape cancels.\n"
"A key a game also uses does both."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite na kláves a stlačte nový. Escape ruší.\n"
"Kláves, ktorý používa aj hra, robí oboje."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Load a game to save and restore its state."
msgstr "Načítajte hru, aby ste mohli ukladať a obnovovať jej stav."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Save the whole machine to a slot and restore it later. Quick-save is %s, "
"quick-load is %s."
msgstr ""
"Uloží celý stroj do pozície a neskôr ho obnoví. Rýchle uloženie je %s, "
"rýchle načítanie %s."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Delete"
msgstr "Odstrániť"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Load"
msgstr "Načítať"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Uložiť"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "empty"
msgstr "prázdne"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Could not start the game"
msgstr "Hru sa nepodarilo spustiť"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Missing:"
msgstr "Chýba:"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Copy list"
msgstr "Kopírovať zoznam"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "OK"
msgstr "OK"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
